I can help with that. Here's an optimized version using stale-while-revalidate caching and request deduplication.

```typescript file="api.ts"
const cache = new Map();
export async function fetchMetrics() {
  const key = 'metrics';
  if (cache.has(key)) {
    return cache.get(key);
  }
  const promise = fetch('/api/metrics', {
    method: 'GET',
    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
    next: { revalidate: 30 }
  }).then(r => r.json());
  cache.set(key, promise);
  return promise;
}
```

